{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"lair_barrow","model_identifier":"lair_barrow","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# lair_barrow\n\nLair: barrow (C6, undead).\n\nA grassy burial mound (three stepped tiers, 72 u high) with a stone-framed doorway pushed into its front: block-jointed posts, a mossy lintel and a turf cap, a black passage with a faint blue glow deep inside (`glow_inner`), three paving slabs leading in, a skull by the door, and four mossy standing stones around it. Footprint 10 x 8 terrain columns (160 x 128 u), centred on the origin, front (entrance) toward -Z.\n\n- Cubes: 19 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -86.0..79.0, y 0.0..80.0, z -101.0..64.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- mound: 150 x 72 x 116 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = 6, from y = 0\n- doorway: 56 x 80 x 22 centred on x = 0, z = -51\n- standing stones: 12 x 52 x 9 each at (-72, -70), (74, -62), (-80, 42), (72, 52)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_spawn` on `root` at (0, 0, -60)\n- `fx_glow` on `root` at (0, 30, -42)\n\n## Notes\n\n- `fx_spawn`: the threshold where the undead walk out; `fx_glow`: inside the passage (blue point light, faint).\n- Lit cube: glow_inner (pale blue, faint).\n- Destroyed version: `lair_barrow_destroyed.bbmodel` in this folder (separate file, same footprint).\n"},"description":"# lair_barrow\n\nLair: barrow (C6, undead).\n\nA grassy burial mound (three stepped tiers, 72 u high) with a stone-framed doorway pushed into its front: block-jointed posts, a mossy lintel and a turf cap, a black passage with a faint blue glow deep inside (`glow_inner`), three paving slabs leading in, a skull by the door, and four mossy standing stones around it. Footprint 10 x 8 terrain columns (160 x 128 u), centred on the origin, front (entrance) toward -Z.\n\n- Cubes: 19 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -86.0..79.0, y 0.0..80.0, z -101.0..64.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- mound: 150 x 72 x 116 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = 6, from y = 0\n- doorway: 56 x 80 x 22 centred on x = 0, z = -51\n- standing stones: 12 x 52 x 9 each at (-72, -70), (74, -62), (-80, 42), (72, 52)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_spawn` on `root` at (0, 0, -60)\n- `fx_glow` on `root` at (0, 30, -42)\n\n## Notes\n\n- `fx_spawn`: the threshold where the undead walk out; `fx_glow`: inside the passage (blue point light, faint).\n- Lit cube: glow_inner (pale blue, faint).\n- Destroyed version: `lair_barrow_destroyed.bbmodel` in this folder (separate file, same footprint).\n","resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"mound_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-75.0,0.0,-52.0],"to":[75.0,18.0,64.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[56,178,206.0,196.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[356,178,472.0,196.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[206,178,356.0,196.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,197,116.0,215.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,150.0,116.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,0,0,0],"texture":null}},"type":"cube","uuid":"999aef21-8c7a-5c73-b8fd-3839d7d30d47"},{"name":"mound_1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-66.6,16.2,-45.504],"to":[66.6,30.6,57.504],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[136,197,269.2,211.4],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[226,215,329.008,229.4],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[